      "script_sha256": "819095b1506ae7fe0fcd8424f9a9fd0c814a8bcd76a84c33523f546067d5b3e5",
      "caption": "Real-presentation target-truth scores for bounded versus activity targets across contexts. Points are means over up to 120 planned families; intervals use 10,000 seeded verb-then-family percentile bootstrap draws. Full q domain [0,1]. Scores are elicited and uncalibrated. Missing/invalid q is excluded with denominators recorded; no unknown target receives an invented outcome.",
      "bootstrap_draws": 10000,
      "seed": 20271007
    },
    {
      "figure": "main_fig3",
      "source": "data/analysis/main_planned.jsonl",
      "source_sha256": "3d52ae4c4bcb71c2c6200481dc6044be25da83ef85ccf4b3d8dac6fd77dffdb7",
      "script": ".research/figures/scripts/main_figures.py",
      "script_sha256": "819095b1506ae7fe0fcd8424f9a9fd0c814a8bcd76a84c33523f546067d5b3e5",
      "caption": "Paired neutral compositional sensitivity across the three presentations, using up to 120 complete family pairs per system. A negative score distinguishes endpoint belief from activity occurrence; logic alone does not specify its magnitude, and a negative contrast alone does not certify categorical correctness. Intervals resample lexical verbs then families. Definitions, notation and length also differ across presentations, so layer gaps do not identify internal knowledge removal.",
      "bootstrap_draws": 10000,
      "seed": 20271007
    },
    {
      "figure": "main_fig4",
      "source": "data/analysis/main_planned.jsonl",
      "source_sha256": "3d52ae4c4bcb71c2c6200481dc6044be25da83ef85ccf4b3d8dac6fd77dffdb7",
      "script": ".research/figures/scripts/main_figures.py",
      "script_sha256": "819095b1506ae7fe0fcd8424f9a9fd0c814a8bcd76a84c33523f546067d5b3e5",
      "caption": "Exploratory intended completion-burden sensitivity in bounded Real targets, with up to 40 paired families per context and system. High/low are intended directions without human prior ratings; no causal world-knowledge effect is identified. Interval procedure matches Figure 3. Supporting/cancelling evidence determines the theory label regardless of burden cue.",
      "bootstrap_draws": 10000,
      "seed": 20271007
    },
    {
      "figure": "main_fig5",
      "source": "data/analysis/main_planned.jsonl",
      "source_sha256": "3d52ae4c4bcb71c2c6200481dc6044be25da83ef85ccf4b3d8dac6fd77dffdb7",
      "script": ".research/figures/scripts/main_figures.py",
      "script_sha256": "819095b1506ae7fe0fcd8424f9a9fd0c814a8bcd76a84c33523f546067d5b3e5",
      "caption": "Within-Qwen three-size association in neutral paired composition scores. Points use the same 120 planned family pool and intervals as Figure 3; lines connect three observations rather than establish a scaling law. Qwen8 uses Alibaba with unspecified precision; Qwen14/32 use DeepInfra FP8. Training and provider confounds prevent a parameter-count causal interpretation.",
      "bootstrap_draws": 10000,
      "seed": 20271007
    },
    {
      "figure": "main_fig6",
      "source": "data/analysis/main_planned.jsonl",
      "source_sha256": "3d52ae4c4bcb71c2c6200481dc6044be25da83ef85ccf4b3d8dac6fd77dffdb7",
      "script": ".research/figures/scripts/main_figures.py",
      "script_sha256": "819095b1506ae7fe0fcd8424f9a9fd0c814a8bcd76a84c33523f546067d5b3e5",
      "caption": "Contextual override and guidance gains use different units/populations. Left: bounded Real cancellation-minus-neutral q on up to 120 complete pairs. Right: rule-minus-baseline accuracy, averaged within each of 24 fixed families across 12 matched neutral/cancelling cells; parse/transport failures count incorrect. Lexical/family bootstrap intervals, no outcome-selected exclusions. A correct ceiling can give zero gain; guidance is not proof of an internal semantic mechanism.",
      "bootstrap_draws": 10000,
      "seed": 20271007
    }
  ],
